  "claim": "The builder of Shadow Creek Golf Course is an Austrian-born American real estate developer. The builder also owns the Encore hotel and casino in the town where Carolyn Goodman (politician) is mayor.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Encore Las Vegas. Sentence: Encore Las Vegas (also called Encore at Wynn Las Vegas; often just called Encore) is a luxury resort, casino and hotel located on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\nPage: Encore Las Vegas. Sentence: The resort is connected to its sister resort, Wynn Las Vegas; both are owned by Wynn Resorts, headed by casino developer Steve Wynn.\nPage: Steve Wynn. Sentence: Stephen Alan Wynn (\"né\" Weinberg; born January 27, 1942) is an American real estate businessman and art collector.\nPage: Shadow Creek Golf Course. Sentence: Shadow Creek is an 18-hole golf course in North Las Vegas, Nevada, designed by Tom Fazio and built by Las Vegas casino magnate Steve Wynn in 1989.\nPage: Carolyn Goodman (politician). Sentence: She has been the mayor of Las Vegas, Nevada since 2011.",
